{"id": "lg_elec-2026-11-04-009", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["lg_elec", "tcl", "samsung_elec", "lg_display"], "customers": ["lg_elec", "samsung_elec"], "suppliers": ["lg_display"]}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["多公司提及", "供應鏈上下游同時提及"]}, "title": "Is OLED inkjet printing coming back? TCL's projects, Samsung's return, and the signals that will tell us whether printing finally wins", "content": "<p>For twenty years, inkjet printing has been the OLED industry's technology of the future - and it has stayed that way. <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/cdt/cdt_demonstrates_milestone_in_oled_displays\">Cambridge Display Technology printed a 14-inch OLED prototype in 2005</a>. <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/lg-display-start-pilot-production-ink-jet-oleds-2017\">LG Display built a printed OLED TV pilot line in 2017</a>, <a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/samsung-progresses-its-inkjet-printin", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/inkjet-printing-coming-back-printed-oleds-perovskites-and-signals-will-tell-us", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "raydium-2026-11-04-010", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["raydium"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.75, "keywords": ["decline", "slow"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["涉及財報", "情緒極端"]}, "title": "Raydium faces 4Q26 slowdown after AI capacity fears fuel customer stockpiling", "content": "Display driver IC designer Raydium Semiconductor reported consolidated revenue of NT$6.57 billion (&asymp; US$200 million) for the third quarter of 2026, down 3.8% sequentially but up 21.0% year on year. Gross margin reached 26.4%, rising 0.7pp from the previous quarter but falling 2.2pp from a year earlier. Operating profit declined 13.1% sequentially and 11.7% year on year to NT$310 million.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20261104PD244/driver-ic-raydium-demand-capacity-revenue.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-11-04-011", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": [], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Broadcom loses final appeal over Samsung chip supply deal", "content": "South Korea's Supreme Court has upheld a KRW18.664 billion (approx. US$13.9 million) fine against Broadcom for pressuring Samsung Electronics into a long-term smartphone component purchasing agreement by disrupting supplies, bringing the US chipmaker's legal challenge to an end.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20261104VL221/samsung-broadcom-supreme-smartphone-2023.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-04-012", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Onsemi to buy Ferric for US$600M to strengthen AI processor power delivery", "content": "Onsemi has agreed to acquire Ferric, Inc., a developer of integrated voltage regulator (IVR) technology, for US$600 million in cash plus up to US$175 million in contingent consideration tied to revenue milestones, the company announced on November 2, 2026. Alongside the deal, Onsemi raised its 2030 AI data center revenue target by US$500 million to more than US$3 billion.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20261104PR201/onsemi-processor-technology-revenue-growth.html", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-04-013", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 1.0, "keywords": ["record"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.9, "reasons": ["涉及財報", "情緒極端"]}, "title": "Weblink International posts record 3Q26 profit on AI demand", "content": "Weblink International Inc. reported record profit for both the third quarter of 2026 and the first three quarters, driven by growing enterprise AI adoption and sales of new products. The company's board approved its third-quarter 2026 financial report on November 3.", "sources": [{"name": "digitimes_display", "url": "https://www.digitimes.com/news/a20261104PD250/weblink-profit-demand-2026-sales.html", "type": "rss"}]}
